 .../res/mipmap-hdpi/ic_launcher_round.png     | Bin 4117 -> 6765 bytes
 .../mipmap-mdpi/ic_launcher_foreground.png    | Bin 8220 -> 13824 bytes
 .../res/mipmap-mdpi/ic_launcher_round.png     | Bin 2122 -> 3464 bytes
 .../mipmap-xhdpi/ic_launcher_foreground.png   | Bin 28612 -> 50066 bytes
 .../res/mipmap-xhdpi/ic_launcher_round.png    | Bin 6657 -> 11282 bytes
 .../mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher_foreground.png  | Bin 61364 -> 111223 bytes
 .../res/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher_round.png   | Bin 13702 -> 23261 bytes
 .../mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher_foreground.png | Bin 108610 -> 201506 bytes
